              "value": "(primal, transmutation)\n\nTrigger: The charau-ka's turn begins\n\nFrequency: 1/hour\n\nThe charau-ka is quickened until the end of their turn and can use the extra action only to Stride or Strike. While in the frenzy, the charau-ka can't speak and automatically critically fails Stealth checks, due to their loud wailing."
